fDE40e52xWAc2kGu08rvTgZBHA&oe=6AF20231"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SimionVR", "keywords": ["Monkey", "SimionVR", "Simion", "Simian", "gorilla"], "long_description": "Run, climb, and swing as a Simian using gorilla locomotion \u2014 just your hands and arms, push off surfaces to jump, grab on to climb.\n\nWhy Players Are Choosing SimionVR\n\nMultiple Game Modes\n\nTag, PvP, horror, and more \u2014 jump into whatever mode fits how you want to play, whether that's classic chase, competing against other players, or surviving something worse.\n\nGrowing Community\n\nOur Discord is packed with active players, always looking for people to swing with, whether you're in it for casual matches or trying to climb the ranks.\n\nCosmetics That Actually Mean Something\n\nEarn Leaves just by playing, and spend them on cosmetics to make your Simian yours. New drops keep the grind worth it.\n\nBuilt By Players, For Players\n\nWe're always adding new content, modes, and maps based on what the community actually wants.\n\nSupport For Creators\n\nTools and support to help creators build and share their own content within SimionVR.\n\nPick a mode. Swing in.", "short_description": "Run, climb, and swing through the forest using gorilla locomotion. Multiple game modes including Tag, PvP, and horror, earn Leaves, and gear up your Simian with cosmetics. Pick a mode and swing in."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.simionvr.com/policys", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.simionvr.com/policys", "publisher_name": "Simion.INC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.simionvr.com/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_